Subject: [PATCH] riscv: spacemit: preserve validated K1 DDR and QSPI fixes

Backport the four upstream changes after k1-bl-v2.2.11-release that were
already included in the MUSE-Card firmware validated by sdsat-forge.
These retain the DDR training fixes while using an official release tag
as the source version. The resulting source tree matches upstream
7f51f4453f9811eeaafbdd839b1bf1b0cc27a413 before the local minimal-U-Boot patch.

Upstream changes:
- 8e9dcdf49ab97d089ad81ba9aaa788d88ab467f7: add ZB25LQ128C NOR identification
- 80a1a841d8c43f7e20b1892c91f95da1edabbebb: fix K1 QSPI mapping above 13 MiB
- 7022203259b73b9c04c1301b153c5532b40958b8: tune LPDDR4/4X IO parameters
- 90317d2789c705ed0f46ddc83859b8177d833793: fix LPDDR4X training at 2133 MT/s

Source: https://github.com/spacemit-com/uboot-2022.10/compare/k1-bl-v2.2.11-release...7f51f4453f9811eeaafbdd839b1bf1b0cc27a413

diff --git a/arch/riscv/dts/k1-x.dtsi b/arch/riscv/dts/k1-x.dtsi
index 341a4129cd..b4a77fbbda 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/dts/k1-x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/riscv/dts/k1-x.dtsi
@@ -746,12 +746,12 @@
 			#address-cells = <1>;
 			#size-cells = <0>;
 			reg = <0x0 0xd420c000 0x0 0x1000>,
-			      <0x0 0xb8000000 0x0 0xd00000>;
+			      <0x0 0xb8000000 0x0 0x1000000>;
 			reg-names = "qspi-base", "qspi-mmap";
-			qspi-sfa1ad = <0xa00000>;
-			qspi-sfa2ad = <0xb00000>;
-			qspi-sfb1ad = <0xc00000>;
-			qspi-sfb2ad = <0xd00000>;
+			qspi-sfa1ad = <0x1000000>;
+			qspi-sfa2ad = <0x2000000>;
+			qspi-sfb1ad = <0x2800000>;
+			qspi-sfb2ad = <0x3000000>;
 			clocks = <&ccu CLK_QSPI>,
 				<&ccu CLK_QSPI_BUS>;
 			clock-names = "qspi_clk", "qspi_bus_clk";
